+```
+
+Result: `12_print_proof_identity.log`.
+
+The trusted mechanical proof gate was run with:
+
+```sh
+PATH=/opt/elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.22.0/bin:$PATH \
+LEAN_SYSROOT=/opt/elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.22.0 \
